---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Self-Esteem Training in Kathmandu: 'I Love Myself' Series" 
  description="A 12-module weekend self-esteem training series in Kathmandu to help you understand, respect and accept yourself. Open to everyone. Check dates and enrol."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">Self-Help & Wellness</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Self-Esteem Training Series: "I Love and Respect Myself"</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Many of us carry a harsh inner critic, a fear of not being good enough, or a habit of putting ourselves last. This series is a structured, supportive programme designed to help you build a kinder relationship with yourself, and live with more confidence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">Format at a glance</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Length:</strong> 12 modules, each four hours (48 hours in total)</li>
          <li><strong>Schedule:</strong> Weekends</li>
          <li><strong>Who it is for:</strong> Adults from all walks of life (Small Group)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">Check availability and enrol</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>